  "story": {
    "day": 43,
    "title": "Kaya's New Year's Day",
    "sentences": [
      "On New Year's Day, Kaya visited a temple.",
      "Her whole family was there, including her uncle.",
      "The temple ground was very busy.",
      "Kaya wore her beautiful pink and purple jacket.",
      "She saw a young girl with white hair ribbons.",
      "Her mother called Kaya for a photo.",
      "\"Aren't these decorations great, right?\" her mother asked.",
      "Kaya felt really hungry, so they stopped for fruit and a vegetable juice.",
      "A small white chair was near the counter.",
      "Kaya saw her old elementary school teacher, who waved.",
      "\"Who's that, Mom?\" she asked. \"Uh-huh, it's Ms. Sato!\"",
      "Kaya thought about her computer games at home."
    ]
  }
}